Package: prombee
Version: @VERSION@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Flo-Ari <Flo-Ari@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-webkit-6.0
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Flo-Ari/Prombee
Description: Prombee prompt editor
 A lightweight desktop prompt editor with hierarchical Markdown headings,
 numbered items, clipboard sharing, history comparison and copy preview.
 Uses the distribution's GTK 4 and WebKitGTK 6 runtime libraries.
